      "content": "idk i just feel like i know my body and these hives r pretty small. i dont really have an inhaler or anything like that so i'm not worried about breathing issues. i just need the energy boost for this session lol. if i take the pre-workout will the caffeine help mask the itchiness or something? i just dont want to feel sluggish halfway through my sets.",
