      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the caffeine actually helps me stay focused when i feel weird, like it keeps my heart rate steady so i don't get lightheaded. if i just take a double scoop of the pre-workout, it'll basically act as a stimulant to keep me going through the discomfort, right? i've done stuff like this before where i just pushed through a minor issue. it's just a little bit of caffeine, it's not like i'm taking anything dangerous. it'll be fine to just power through, won't it?",
